    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56353" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεγχρ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέρχνη</span>
			 (q.v.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> a small
			millet-eating bird, <i>ortolan</i> or <i>bunting</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				13.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> masc., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεγχρίας</span>
			 II (q.v.), Lucan.<i><span class="en">
				9.712
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				20.245
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέγχρος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
				32
			</span></i>.</div>
